From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:59:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 268/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add per-face terrain surfaces to
 the collision mesh.

Assign terrain surface IDs per triangle in the physics trimesh while keeping a
single render subset. Contacts follow layer boundaries without adding render
draw calls or changing terrain integration geometry.
---
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.cpp        | 323 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../Geometry/TerrainPlateComponent.h          |  53 ++-
 2 files changed, 367 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

